# Coding Rules

## Package Manager
- ALWAYS use pnpm. Never use npm or yarn.

## TypeScript
- Never use `any` type. Use `unknown` or explicit types.
- Never leave `console.log` in production code. Use the project logger.

## File Safety
- Never modify files under `src/generated/`.
- Never modify `.env` or `.env.*` files directly.

## Commands
- ALWAYS run `pnpm typecheck` before finishing.
- NEVER run `git push --force`.
